01:16:57.000 --> 01:16:57.720
Schließlich das Ende.

01:16:58.600 --> 01:16:58.960
Stilllegung.

01:16:59.360 --> 01:17:00.000
Die meisten Agenten

01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:00.660
